sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent / Client
    participant OIDC as OIDCAuthMiddleware<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Validator as OIDCValidator / TokenReviewValidator
    participant JWKS as OIDC Provider<br/>JWKS Endpoint
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server
    participant PluginMgr as PluginManager<br/>(pluggy)
    participant RBAC as Tool-Level RBAC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Agent,K8sAPI: MCP Tool Invocation Flow (OIDC Enabled)

    Agent->>OIDC: MCP Request (SSE/Streamable-HTTP)<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    OIDC->>Validator: Validate Token

    alt JWT Mode
        Validator->>JWKS: Fetch JWKS keys
        JWKS-->>Validator: Public keys
        Validator->>Validator: Verify JWT signature + claims
    else TokenReview Mode
        Validator->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews
        K8sAPI-->>Validator: TokenReview response (user info)
    end

    Validator-->>OIDC: Authenticated user context
    OIDC->>MCP: Forward request with user context

    Note over MCP,RBAC: Tool Discovery & RBAC Filtering

    MCP->>PluginMgr: Load registered tools
    PluginMgr-->>MCP: Available tools + permission mappings
    MCP->>RBAC: Filter tools for user
    RBAC->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check user permissions)
    K8sAPI-->>RBAC: Allowed/Denied per tool
    RBAC-->>MCP: Filtered tool list

    Note over MCP,K8sAPI: Tool Execution (e.g., create workbench)

    MCP->>K8sAPI: Create Notebook CR<br/>Impersonate: <authenticated-user><br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>MCP: Notebook created
    MCP-->>Agent: MCP Tool Result

    Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Health Check (No Auth Required)

    Agent->>MCP: GET /health
    MCP-->>Agent: 200 OK
